GRAMMAR.md §7.1, §7.2 (DECISIONS 332): a root name in project.local.canon is an identifier, as in project.canon; a quoted one is refused even when it names a declared root.
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
  roots {
    resource: "res"
  }
}
-- project.local.canon --
project acme {
  roots {
    "resource": "/home/sam/Resource"
  }
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E1007]  project.local.canon:3:5
  invalid root name "resource": a root name is an identifier

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
